Forbidden.description:
You are signed in and may not do this. Three different things answer `403`, and the body
does not say which:

- your role lacks the permission — reading needs the one to view bots, every write the one to
  edit them;
- the brand is disabled or locked, on any operation;
- the brand's subscription has expired, on a write. Reading still works.

rules.description:
Constraints beyond the type. Only rules that can be stated declaratively appear here;
rules that depend on the brand's own data, such as whether an integration credential
belongs to it, are enforced on write and reported as violations.
